{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "030mak_401_2_4_030_01_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:bd4ae731826539cd13bbeb7e3d9732270e6e28ceab8d33b1145dc63416929afe",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:030mak_401_2_4_030_01_09_a:2_4_030_01_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fe176c7d7536e2d7cb9ef506ccfde4a99b6b068d364e3b7e1417ecfc94034f8",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_401_2_4_030_01_09_a:2_4_030_01_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1270858f07d044358280b7467da58bcb5b02c2962687252d85d8ed9f864c1967",
      "text": "现在方便吗？\n家里人跟我说了运动会的感想。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_401_2_4_030_01_09_a:2_4_030_01_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1d315a2f46d6823c7c9af7aff6c180d16321e479e162b9799da458d5b9f25f2",
      "text": "他们说投球入筐的我也看起来很开心的样子……总觉得，好高兴啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_401_2_4_030_01_09_a:2_4_030_01_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9d2379c200ca86ce75c94f2862e7aeab3461f9a804a8c18157efbcc86ae0378",
      "text": "还说，看到我那副模样，粉丝大家也都很高兴哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_401_2_4_030_01_09_a:2_4_030_01_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad32437e9fa7972cb8afa74e8e6efe16bf5b257d117b1796bc11d01ac2ec0872",
      "text": "这让我意识到，正因为当时我是发自内心地笑着，观众们才会也跟着一起露出笑容呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_401_2_4_030_01_09_a:2_4_030_01_09_a:cmd-000016:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e880162892c336935f4266bd52441fb18da66a69d391bc92cfa848926d26a9b1",
      "text": "这正是卷绪先生的\n魅力所在吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_401_2_4_030_01_09_a:2_4_030_01_09_a:cmd-000017:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c37d8f286ff9702483d21a57ccc5f92f18447d264354976ddfef7d5aa830df59",
      "text": "是一份能让大家了解您\n魅力的工作呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_401_2_4_030_01_09_a:2_4_030_01_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15660f8d02e93ce2e2e25a949e8667ddeeca1b988813d4650a416eff8698f269",
      "text": "我的魅力……\n能被你这么说，我就安心了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_401_2_4_030_01_09_a:2_4_030_01_09_a:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:878228594f94217e7c3406aac844903fef80872e26d8a5ebc946a439512fc439",
      "text": "被身边的人当面夸奖，\n果然还是会觉得有点不好意思呢……呵呵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:030mak_401_2_4_030_01_09_a:2_4_030_01_09_a:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2120e92acff8f2ac49b7af02184768ce394e79ac84d762ad8ba920927ab27880",
      "text": "这样的日子真想吃特制的蛋糕！\n我会买去事务所当慰劳品的哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
